// Per-developer Xcode signing settings — not committed (see ios/.gitignore).
//
// Copy this file to Local.xcconfig and fill in your own Apple Developer
// Team ID to build/run on a real device or produce a locally-signed
// release build. Find your Team ID in Xcode → Runner target → Signing &
// Capabilities → Team, or at https://developer.appleid.apple.com/account
// under Membership.
